  "summary_text": "Acmeway\nAcmeway wants a CSV export of seat usage\nEdge cases and escalation path and reporting export\nFeedback on edge cases from someone on sales: they were kind of lukewarm\nEdge cases is half done\nEscalation path is surprisingly okay\nNotes on escalation path added to the doc\nSuggestion to check with legal before touching reporting export\nPreference to set up a short sync rather than draw it on a whiteboard\nFeedback and kickoff deck and notes from last time\nFeedback is in good shape\nFeedback is low risk\nNo clear owner for kickoff deck\nNotes from last time is a nice to have\nNotes from last time is a little behind\nMobile adoption and procurement steps and user provisioning\nMobile adoption is still a mess\nMobile adoption is kind of fragile honestly\nProcurement steps is kind of fragile honestly\nProcurement steps is sort of on hold\nSuggestion to get more data before touching user provisioning\nTrial period and admin console and action items\nTrial period is way overdue\nSuggestion to split it into two pieces before touching trial period\nNotes on admin console added to the doc\nConcern with action items: that we end up rebuilding it\nOriginal proposal and executive sponsor and rollout plan\nOriginal proposal: it's been quiet\nExecutive sponsor is ahead of where i expected\nRollout plan is sort of on hold",
  "summary_markdown": "### Acmeway\n- Acmeway wants a CSV export of seat usage\n\n### Edge cases and escalation path and reporting export\n- Feedback on edge cases from someone on sales: they were kind of lukewarm\n  - Edge cases is half done\n- Escalation path is surprisingly okay\n  - Notes on escalation path added to the doc\n- Suggestion to check with legal before touching reporting export\n- Preference to set up a short sync rather than draw it on a whiteboard\n\n### Feedback and kickoff deck and notes from last time\n- Feedback is in good shape\n  - Feedback is low risk\n- No clear owner for kickoff deck\n- Notes from last time is a nice to have\n  - Notes from last time is a little behind\n\n### Mobile adoption and procurement steps and user provisioning\n- Mobile adoption is still a mess\n  - Mobile adoption is kind of fragile honestly\n- Procurement steps is kind of fragile honestly\n  - Procurement steps is sort of on hold\n- Suggestion to get more data before touching user provisioning\n\n### Trial period and admin console and action items\n- Trial period is way overdue\n  - Suggestion to split it into two pieces before touching trial period\n- Notes on admin console added to the doc\n- Concern with action items: that we end up rebuilding it\n\n### Original proposal and executive sponsor and rollout plan\n- Original proposal: it's been quiet\n- Executive sponsor is ahead of where i expected\n- Rollout plan is sort of on hold",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
