      },
      "text": "I guess we said we'd simplify it and then the like feedback from their managers happened. I feel like we should probably check with legal before we touch the reporting export. The way I see it, I was looking at the roadmap call earlier and it's mostly what we talked about, if that helps. Yeah. the integration with their HR system took like 10 minutes like last time, I think. Um, did anyone look at the open questions before this call? I feel like the priority list is still a mess, so yeah. Yeah no, we've been saying we'd timebox it for a while, but yeah.",
