    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "From my side, I think the feedback is in good shape and the champion on their side is low risk, so maybe set up a short sync. Anyway, we lost most of the like afternoon on the sandbox account on Friday.",
