      },
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:08:39.657000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:08:40.257000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:08:43.871000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:08:44.471000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth, we should probably probably get more data before we touch the user provisioning. And then it feels like the invoicing setup and the training sessions are kind of the same like problem. Also, I think think the spreadsheet is a bit messy and and the kickoff deck is is ahead of where I like expected, so maybe map out the edge cases. To be fair, I'd rather set up a short sync than draw it on a whiteboard, to be honest. So the feedback from their managers came up over the weekend too, to be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:08:45.709000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:19.043000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Look, I'd love to make it someone's job, but the trial period is way overdue.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:19.047000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:24.047000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, the last time we touched the ownership question it was half done, kind of.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:24.348000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:29.348000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "From my side, Acmeway is kind of the test case for the integration with their HR system, honestly. So on Acmeway, it kind of works, you know what I mean.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:29.362000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:39.362000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually, I put some notes on the admin console in the doc, or whatever.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:39.679000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:44.345000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And does the original proposal actually matter for Acmeway?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:44.420000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:47.420000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "We'd probably start with around 40 seats.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:48.853000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:51.187000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:51.516000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:52.116000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, totally",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:52.150000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:52.816000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Okay",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:52.827000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:53.427000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "so I wouldn't block on the follow ups, to be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:09:59.262000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:02.929000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Also, my worry with the action items is that we end up rebuilding it",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:02.979000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:07.646000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dana Ortiz"
      },
      "text": "We've been saying we'd pair on it for a while, kind of. So there's a world where we keep it behind a flag and the timeline just goes away.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:12.943000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:22.610000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, there's a world where we do a quick spike and the spreadsheet just like goes away.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:22.621000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:28.288000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dana Ortiz"
      },
      "text": "Makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:26.403000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:27.003000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "True",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:28.619000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:29.219000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So yeah",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:29.413000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:30.080000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "we've been saying we'd test it with a few users for a while",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:30.128000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:34.461000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "like or whatever.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:34.499000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:35.499000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So for Acmeway specifically, the mobile adoption is kind of fragile honestly, more or less",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:35.591000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:40.591000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "The way uh, I see it, I feel um, like the risks is a little fragile, kind of.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:40.615000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:46.615000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Wait, really?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:46.638000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:47.305000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Right, and I'm fine about the tradeoffs, at least for now",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:47.620000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:51.287000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dana Ortiz"
      },
      "text": "Sorry, the last time we touched the backlog it was sort of on hold, for like what it's worth. Mm, it's like, the doc is the easy part and nobody wants to say say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:10:51.378000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:03.045000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Right.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:04.628000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:05.228000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "I guess honestly the reporting export only needs twenty minutes if we make it someone's job.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:05.286000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:10.619000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Ha, yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:08.898000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:09.498000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "That's really helpful...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:10.672000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:11.672000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Let me like take the export back",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:19.695000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:22.028000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "too the team.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:22.031000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:23.031000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Um, did anyone look at the scope earlier?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:23.341000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:26.007000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:27.228000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:27.828000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I think the feedback is low risk and the like admin console is way more complicated than it looks, so maybe agree on what done means.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:28.447000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:37.114000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "No, totally",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:37.433000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:38.099000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "We've been saying we'd check with legal for a while, more or less. The short version is the notes from last time is a little like behind.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:38.116000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:47.116000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah. I was looking at the original proposal a while back back and it's been quiet. Also, can we start with the boring version?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:47.119000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:55.119000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Mm.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:51.794000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:52.394000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dana Ortiz"
      },
      "text": "I think the support tickets is in good shape and the follow ups is a little fragile, so maybe timebox it. Also, on Acmeway, nobody's really touched it in a while, I think",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:11:55.175000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:06.175000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Wait, really?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:06.266000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:06.933000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So I'd love to pair on it, but the executive sponsor is ahead of where I expected.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:06.948000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:12.614000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Basically I put some notes on the escalation path in the doc, if that makes sense. Which, I keep coming back to the metrics. Right, and we should probably split it into two pieces before we touch the trial period. And then I wouldn't block on the original proposal, at least for now. Yeah, it's funny, the tradeoffs looked ahead of where I expected on Friday and now there's more going on than I thought. And then honestly the security questionnaire only needs a couple of hours if we start with the boring version. I guess the rollout plan is sort of on hold, I don't know. And I feel like the priority list is in good shape, if that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:12.676000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:53.343000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:55.960000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:56.560000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Wait, can we park like it for now? Okay, if the priority list slips again, Acmeway is going to feel it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:12:58.336000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:13:05.336000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:13:02.092000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:13:02.692000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Right.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:13:05.368000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-02T16:13:05.968000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Okay, thanks everyone.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-02T16:13:17.758000Z",
